      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:4:2:82:2",
      "text": [
        " سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) عَنْ مُعْتَكِفٍ وَاقَعَ أَهْلَهُ قَالَ هُوَ بِمَنْزِلَةِ مَنْ أَفْطَرَ يَوْماً مِنْ شَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Abdul Rahman Bin Abu Najran, from Abdullah Bin Mugheira, from Sama’at Bin Mihran who said, ",
          "‘I asked Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> about the one performing <span class=\"iTxt\">Itikaaf</span> falling upon his wife. He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘He is as the status of the one who breaks a Fast of a day from the Month of Ramazan’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "2. A number of our people have narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from ‘Abd al-Rahman ibn abu Najran from ‘Abd Allah ibn al- Mughirah from Sanaa ‘ah ibn Mehran who has said the following: “I once asked abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, about a man who in ‘Itikaf engages in sexual relation with his wife. He (the Imam) said, ‘He is like one who destroys one day of fast in the month of Ramadan.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
